      "id": "claim_1fc2d00aba3b492a86da4a97397b79af",
      "statement": "The agent records invocation start metadata when an invocation ID is available, resolving a person identity and emitting a run.started event with opaque run, thread, task, model, repository, and user identifiers; the effective executed model is left unknown at this stage because routing, fallback, and subagents can differ from the configured model.",
