      "id": "claim_8d5132eeba694f689543087b51b94a1e",
      "statement": "Analytics uses a transactional outbox: enqueue inserts idempotently, the worker claims bounded batches with SKIP LOCKED, successful ingestion is acknowledged, and failures are retried with jittered exponential backoff before dead-lettering at the configured maximum attempts.",
